> > * Using the square root of the cluster size as a covariate works with all species and seems to produce sensible results (in this particular case, dividing the cluster size by the standard deviation of the size values as Dave suggested also yields the error below).
> >
> > My data are fairly simple - four distance bands (or three if I pool the first two bands, which I am minded to do) and cluster sizes that are heavily skewed towards small values. This prompts the following questions:
